# Never upload local settings or data with `vercel deploy`: the apps read the root .env when it exists, so a stray one
# would point the deployment at localhost and ship secrets. The project's environment variables are the settings.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.data/
docs/private/

# Build output and test artefacts
node_modules/
**/.next/
**/.expo/
e2e/report/
e2e/results/
*.tsbuildinfo
